; Lost Zone (doc 100): seats of the drivable cars in multiplayer.
; netcoop_seats = bone[:x:y:z], ... - an offset in the car's space from the
; bone; the first seat drives. Rear rows without a bone of their own are
; offsets from the front seats (the car faces +z). Models whose axes are
; turned keep only their own seat bones.
; netcoop_passenger_drop - passenger pose root below the seat (m).
; UAZ rear bench: the seat_back bone is the top of the backrest (owner's
; screenshot 2026-10-13: passengers sat on it).
; netcoop_trunk - false: no trunk.

